          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">Teaching Ik Onkar, one God; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/japji-sahib">Japji Sahib</a>; 974 hymns in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guru-granth-sahib">Guru Granth Sahib</a>; the udasis; the settlement at Kartarpur; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/langar-sikhism">langar</a>; naam japo, kirat karo and vand chhako</span></div>
